### Test qilish uchun misollar
### Bu faylni VS Code REST Client extension bilan ishlatishingiz mumkin

### 1. Barcha mavjud tillarni ko'rish
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sms/languages

###

### 2. Rus tili shablonini ko'rish
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sms/template/rus

###

### 3. Ingliz tili shablonini ko'rish
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sms/template/ingliz

###

### 4. Bitta raqamga RUS TILI reklamasini yuborish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "998901234567",
  "language": "rus"
}

###

### 5. Bitta raqamga INGLIZ TILI reklamasini yuborish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "998912345678",
  "language": "ingliz"
}

###

### 6. Bitta raqamga TURK TILI reklamasini yuborish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "998901234567",
  "language": "turk"
}

###

### 7. Ko'p raqamlarga RUS TILI reklamasini yuborish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sms/send-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phones": [
    "998901234567",
    "998912345678",
    "998923456789"
  ],
  "language": "rus"
}

###

### 8. Balansni tekshirish
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sms/balance

###

### 9. Server health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### 10. API ma'lumotlari
GET http://localhost:3000/
